  "description": "<p>env-server.sh relies on Fedora being installed in a 'webapps' directory:</p>\n\n<p>set WEBINF=\"%CATALINA_HOME%\\webapps&#37;WEBAPP_NAME%\\WEB-INF\"</p>\n\n<p>when it's installed separately from Tomcat (to allow easier upgrades), e.g.</p>\n\n<p>/WWW/domain.name/fedora</p>\n\n<p>the rebuild fails to run.</p>",
